prompts.content:
Rewrite this responsibility into {{count}} résumé bullet points. Each must follow: strong action verb + what I did + measurable impact. If a metric is missing, leave a clearly marked [add metric] placeholder rather than inventing numbers.

Responsibility: {{responsibility}}
Role/context: {{context}}

Write a concise cover letter (under one page) for the role of {{role}} at {{company}}. Use my background below, connect it to what the role needs, and sound genuine rather than generic. End with a confident closing.

My background: {{background}}
Why this company interests me: {{motivation}}

Help me answer this interview question using the STAR method (Situation, Task, Action, Result): "{{question}}"

Base it on this experience: {{experience}}

Keep it under 90 seconds spoken, lead with the result, and keep it specific.

Help me draft a professional message to negotiate this offer. Be confident and collaborative, not adversarial. Anchor on value and market data, keep the relationship warm, and propose a specific number or range.

The offer: {{offer}}
Market context / comparable pay: {{market_context}}
My leverage (other offers, unique skills): {{leverage}}
